>mirror and bugle.
Keep the unicorn horn!  I use it to "little" things: cure blindness, and I
believe it is capable of curing a couple of other conditions.  The tinning
kit can be used to tin "useful" monsters that you can't eat because you are
full.  Examples: Wraiths, dragons, floating eyes, giants, certain jellys 
et. al.  The mirror can be used for a variety of things:
***SPOILER ALERT***

1)	You can turn Medusa to stone.  Make sure you are blind and are detecting
	her with telepathy, which is obtainable from eating a floating eye,
	or wearing an amulet of esp.
2)	When you are blind and have telepathy, use the mirror.  If you do it
	enough, it will tell you something interesting.
3)	It can be used to scare certain types of monsters, which can be 
	frightened by thier own reflection.

The bugle can be used to open the castle gate, if the gods have told you
the correct tune.  Also, certain types of musical instruments have effects
similar to offensive wands (fire, frost etc)

